mm 1
song "Copper Meadow"
  tempo 115.75389873190409
  key E dorian
  seed 2209
  humanize off
  dynamics flat

fx
  bus dub = delay time 3/8, feedback 87%, tone lp 2400Hz, pingpong 70% -> send plate 25%
  bus quarter = delay time 1/4, feedback 86%, tone bp 1600Hz, pingpong 100% -> send halo 45%
  bus fizz = delay time 1/16t, feedback 65%, tone lp 3500Hz, pingpong 90% -> send plate 15%
  bus plate = reverb decay 3.4s, predelay 1/64, size 70%, damping 7000Hz, mod 20%
  bus halo = reverb decay 14s, predelay 1/16, size 100%, damping 11000Hz, mod 60%

section intro = rest(16 bars)
section groove = rest(32 bars)
section theme = rest(32 bars)
section breakdown = rest(16 bars)
section build = rest(8 bars)
section peak = rest(40 bars)
section outro = rest(16 bars)
form = intro groove theme breakdown build peak outro

signal pump = trigger(kick, decay 1/4)
silence before peak for 1 beat

part drone
  sound round-drone
  mono off
  voices 4
  restart never
  range C2..C4
  cutoff = 0.3
  send.plate = 0.4
  level.db = -4
  plays line | E2+B2{velocity 0.6} _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . | | . . . . . . . . . . . .